+## Gap / Observation V1: Browser LARP command fails before navigation
+
+**Symptom**: `playwright screenshot file://web/demo.html` and the absolute local file URL both abort before navigation with `bootstrap_check_in ... Permission denied (1100)`.
+
+**Reproduction**: From repository root, run `playwright screenshot 'file://web/demo.html' /tmp/s010-supplied-route.png`.
+
+**Root cause**: The host browser process cannot register its macOS Mach-port rendezvous service in the restricted execution environment. The supplied route is also a relative `file://` URL rather than a project-root absolute URL.
+
+**Severity**: P2
+
+**Patch applied** (if any):
