+none — validation report records the reproduced failure and retains NO-SHIP
+```
+
+**Proposed upstream fix**: In UI validation fixtures, provide a target build plus a portable local-server route and a scripted browser fallback that can run where macOS browser-process registration is unavailable.
+
+**Impact**: Runtime pixels could not be captured here; independently, static inspection found the feature implementation absent.
